+          <dd pn="section-2.1-2.16">The server on which a given resource resides or is to be created.</dd>
+          <dt pn="section-2.1-2.17">proxy</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-2.1-2.18">An intermediary program which acts as both a server and a client
